  "composition": "Paint after MAP scenery in unchanged explicit rectangles. Center a single text line vertically within its existing paper panel, preserving exact font and size. WORLD has no feature-label overlay. Actual navigation/44px screen targets are consumer-owned.",
  "authority": "All six annotation interaction_id/place_id fields are null. MAIN STAGE/PLAZA are virtual scenery; WALL/FEED/MEET/GIFTS are closed feature intents. Canonical stage_info/gifts_info identities and reviewed-place catalog/safety remain separate and unchanged. No food/retail/physical route or eligibility is introduced.",
  "runtime_resources": "No new runtime PNG or font. Original target JPEG is reference/provenance only, never a product texture. Frozen architecture/landscape/massing inputs are pinned lineage, not automatic activation.",
  "provenance": {
    "icons": "Original hand-authored feed/message and wall/mural-grid polygons in this build.py; existing stage/people/gift vectors exact. No utensil/shopping glyph in this version; no raster extraction.",
